1734
01:42:47,300 --> 01:42:50,900
involved in this, and therefore,

1735
01:42:50,900 --> 01:42:53,540
you know, this gets back to the fact that

1736
01:42:53,540 --> 01:42:57,699
something like a house has a use-value and
