1770
01:44:41,189 --> 01:44:42,130
In other words:

1771
01:44:42,130 --> 01:44:43,869
those are open questions.

1772
01:44:43,869 --> 01:44:47,479
And Marx is very much open to

1773
01:44:47,479 --> 01:44:49,459
